---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | RentMap';
const description = 'How RentMap handles rental listing submissions, usage data, cookies and advertising.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical="https://rentmap.net/privacy/">
  <style>
    :global(body) { background:#0b1020; color:#e2e8f0; overflow:auto; height:auto; min-height:100vh; }
    .page { max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; padding:48px 20px 48px; }
    h1 { color:#fff; font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,42px); line-height:1.1; margin-bottom:14px; }
    h2 { color:#fff; font-size:22px; margin:34px 0 10px; }
    p, li { color:#cbd5e1; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; }
    p { margin:0 0 16px; }
    ul { padding-left:22px; margin:0 0 16px; }
    li + li { margin-top:8px; }
    .updated { color:#94a3b8; font-size:14px; }
    a { color:#c4b5fd; }
  </style>
  <main class="page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    <p>This policy explains how RentMap handles information when you use <a href="https://rentmap.net/">rentmap.net</a>.</p>

    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>When you submit a rental listing, we may receive the listing URL, rent details, location, property information and the email address you provide. We use this information to review submissions, maintain the rental-price dataset and communicate about a submission when necessary.</p>

    <h2>Technical and usage information</h2>
    <p>Our hosting and security providers may process standard technical information such as IP address, browser type, request time, referring page and device information to deliver, secure and improve the site. We do not sell personal information.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>RentMap uses Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads based on visits to this and other websites. Google’s advertising cookies enable Google and its partners to serve personalised or non-personalised ads, depending on a visitor’s choices and location.</p>
    <p>Visitors can control personalised advertising through <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google’s Ad Center</a> or opt out through <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener noreferrer">About Ads</a>. Where consent is required, we will provide a consent choice before using advertising cookies.</p>

    <h2>Service providers and links</h2>
    <p>RentMap uses third-party services to host the site and provide map imagery or related functionality. The site also links to external rental portals. Those services have their own privacy practices, and we are not responsible for their content or policies.</p>

    <h2>Data retention and your choices</h2>
    <p>We keep submission information only for as long as needed to operate and improve RentMap, resolve disputes or meet legal obligations. You can ask us to access, correct or delete personal information connected with a listing submission by contacting us.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:kontakt@lejel.dk">kontakt@lejel.dk</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
